			"notes": "### New loading splash screen\n\n- Replaced the old green ASCII console window with a modern dark splash card.\n- Minimal horizon logo mark, version and Minecraft/Fabric badges, greeting.\n- The progress bar follows the client's real startup stages, with a percentage.\n- Fades in when the game starts loading and fades out once Horizon is ready. Drag it anywhere, or close it with the X.\n\nIncludes everything from 2.0.3 (BedAura, AnchorAura, HighwayBuilder, ChestAura, DiscordAlerts, AutoMount, EntityControl, AutoDrop, ArmorAlert, Ambience)."
		},
