			"notes": "### Major Feature Update: 10 New Modules\n\n- **BedAura** (Attack): Fast autonomous Bed bombing in Nether & End. Smart yaw placement (North/South/East/West), power 5.0 damage prediction, anti-suicide checks, auto-refill, silent swapping, and 3D shader/fill/outline ESP.\n- **AnchorAura** (Attack): Autonomous 3-phase Respawn Anchor combat in Overworld & End. Places anchor -> charges with glowstone -> detonates with uncharged item/hand. Silent swapping, friendly protection, and 3D visual indicators.\n- **HighwayBuilder** (World): Automatic road construction (1 to 5 blocks wide) with obsidian, netherrack, blue ice, or stone beneath player. Supports fast scaffolding across highways.\n- **ChestAura** (World): Autonomous hands-free container looting. Automatically opens nearby chests, trapped chests, barrels, and shulkers with customizable reach and cooldown.\n- **DiscordAlerts** (Misc): Webhook notifications for visual range alerts (enemy player spotted with distance and coordinates), totem pops, low health warnings, and base/stash discoveries. (Webhook URL defaults to empty until configured).\n- **AutoMount** (Player): Automatically mounts nearby horses, donkeys, mules, boats, minecarts, pigs, and striders with sneak-to-dismount bypass.\n- **EntityControl** (Rage): Full movement, steering, and jump control over ridden entities without requiring a saddle or carrot-on-a-stick.\n- **AutoDrop** (Equip): Cleans clutter and unwanted junk (netherrack, cobblestone, diorite, seeds, etc.) while mining or digging, with inventory threshold and container safety.\n- **ArmorAlert** (Protect): Real-time armor and elytra durability monitor with customizable warnings in chat or on-screen HUD when durability drops below threshold.\n- **Ambience** (Cosmetic): Client-side custom time lock (Day, Noon, Sunset, Night, Midnight, Custom) with packet lock to prevent jitter, plus weather overrides (Clear, Rain, Thunder).\n\nTested and verified on Fabric 26.3."
		},
