			"notes": "# Horizon 2.0.2 Update\n\n### ✨ What's New:\n- **Session Stats HUD Widget**: Sleek glassmorphism HUD card displaying Playtime, Kills, Deaths, K/D Ratio, and Totems Popped in real-time.\n- **English Language Polish**: Cleaned up leftover Russian strings in combat notifications and death pop announcements.\n- **Auto-Updater Cleanup**: Headless Windows sleep and automatic sweep of older jars on game startup.\n- **Prefix Support**: Both \\.\\ and \\^\\ command prefixes."
